---
---

<section id="inicio" class="relative flex min-h-screen flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-hidden px-4 pt-28 pb-20 text-center">
	<!-- Fondo de menú con overlay de graduación y viñeta -->
	<div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10">
		<img src="/assets/ui/menu_bg.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="px h-full w-full object-cover object-center scale-105 transition-transform duration-1000" />
		<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-piedra-950/70" aria-hidden="true"></div>
		<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-piedra-950/90 via-transparent to-piedra-950" aria-hidden="true"></div>
		<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,_transparent_0%,_#0d0c14_85%)]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
	</div>

	<div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-5xl flex-col items-center gap-6">
		<!-- Tag Badge -->
		<p class="section-tag !gap-3 reveal">
			<span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 bg-oro-500 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(230,184,77,0.8)]"></span>
			Multijugador de conquista por trivia
		</p>

		<!-- Logo del Juego -->
		<img
			src="/assets/ui/logo.webp"
			alt="BattleGraph"
			class="px reveal w-[min(85vw,28rem)] drop-shadow-[0_10px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]"
			width="320"
			height="108"
			loading="eager"
		/>

		<!-- Título Principal -->
		<h1 class="display reveal max-w-3xl text-crema-100">
			Conquista el grafo.
			<br />
			<span class="text-oro-300 drop-shadow-[0_2px_12px_rgba(230,184,77,0.4)]">Domina por trivia.</span>
		</h1>

		<!-- Descripción -->
		<p class="reveal max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-crema-300 sm:text-lg">
			Cada nodo del mapa es territorio. Responde preguntas antes que tus rivales, activa power-ups tácticos y destruye las bases enemigas.
		</p>

		<!-- Botones de Acción -->
		<div class="reveal mt-2 flex flex-col sm:flex-row w-full sm:w-auto items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 px-4">
			<button type="button" data-open-game class="pixel-btn w-full sm:w-auto !px-6 sm:!px-8 !py-3.5 sm:!py-4 shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(230,184,77,0.35)] cursor-pointer text-sm sm:text-base">
				<span aria-hidden="true">⚔️</span> Jugar Ahora (Web)
			</button>
			<a href="#mapa" class="pixel-btn pixel-btn-secondary w-full sm:w-auto !px-5 sm:!px-6 !py-3.5 sm:!py-4 text-sm sm:text-base">
				<span aria-hidden="true">🗺️</span> Explorar Mapa
			</a>
		</div>

		<!-- Muestra Principal del Juego (hero.webp con Botón de Play Overlay) -->
		<div class="reveal mt-6 sm:mt-8 w-full max-w-4xl px-2">
			<div class="relative group cursor-pointer" data-open-game>
				<div class="absolute -inset-1 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-oro-700/30 via-violeta-600/30 to-oro-700/30 blur-lg opacity-75 group-hover:opacity-100 transition duration-500"></div>
				<img
					src="/hero.webp"
					alt="Gameplay de BattleGraph - Haz clic para jugar"
					class="px relative w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-[0_25px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)] border-2 border-oro-700/40 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-[1.01]"
					loading="eager"
				/>
				<div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-piedra-950/40 group-hover:bg-piedra-950/20 transition-colors rounded-lg">
					<button type="button" data-open-game class="pixel-btn !px-4 !py-2.5 sm:!px-6 sm:!py-3 !text-xs sm:!text-sm shadow-2xl scale-100 sm:scale-110 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform pointer-events-none">
						▶️ Cargar Demo Web
					</button>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>


